<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρός</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δᾱρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>long, too
				long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρὸν χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.206
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				282
			</span></i>: more freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρόν</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνον</span>) as Adv.,
				<i>all too long,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.298
			</span></i>, etc.; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δηρὸν δέ μοι αἰὼν ἔσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.415
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Musae.
				291
			</span></i>: freq. with neg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ σέ φημι δ . . . ἀλύξειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.371
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.435
			</span></i>, etc.: Trag. use only 
				Dor.
			 form, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολὺν δαρόν τε χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					414
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				516
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1339
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρόν</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				648
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				940
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαρὸν χρόνου
			πόδα</span> time's <i>lingering</i> foot, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				889
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
